---
const items = [
  'Hybrid infrastructure on AWS, Azure and on-premise.',
  'Working with Azure since 2023 and several of their most important services (VMs, Networking, Firewalls, NSGs, Backup).',
  'Working with AWS since 2023 and several of their most important services (EC2, ECS, ECR, CloudFront, RDS).',
  'CI/CD pipelines with Azure DevOps and GitHub Actions.',
  'Infrastructure as code (IaC) with Terraform. Automation with Ansible.',
  'Containers with Docker, Docker Compose, Podman and Kubernetes.',
  'Observability with Grafana, Prometheus, Loki and Zabbix.',
  'Legacy infrastructure modernization: OS migrations (RHEL 7→9), applications and databases from VMs to Docker.',
  'Linux specialist — Red Hat Enterprise Linux.',
]
---

<section id='about-me' class="mb-8 scroll-mt-16 md:mb-12 lg:mb-20 lg:scroll-mt-24">
  <div style="color: #e4e4e7; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.625">

    <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold mb-3" style="color: #ffffff">Areas of Knowledge</h3>

    <ul class="space-y-3">
      {items.map((item) => (
        <li class="knowledge-item group flex items-baseline gap-4">
          <span class="dash mt-[0.55em] h-px w-4 shrink-0 transition-all duration-300 motion-reduce:transition-none" style="background-color: #71717a"></span>
          <span>{item}</span>
        </li>
      ))}
    </ul>

  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .knowledge-item:hover .dash {
    width: 1.75rem;
    background-color: #ffffff !important;
  }
</style>
